{
  "description": "Rule 46: CheckOutboundCallStatus in the class's form in a CAMPAIGN flow, the CreateContactFlow type outbound campaigns use. FlowDoc has no CAMPAIGN connectType, so the catalog cannot record the result; rule 46 does. On an instance without campaigns a refusal naming the flow type is recorded as what it was.",
